{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5eb328195bc5109d1afa0db749fa990bd7c0964d5ce596dcc9ace36fbf098c35", "ja": "（今日は真美と、テーマパークでスケートを楽しんだ。\nその後、クリスマスプレゼントを渡したのだが……）", "zh": "（今天和真美在主题乐园享受了滑冰。之后把圣诞礼物送给了她，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "1c8750da2edf136154db160a109c0a2925f0bee69efbacb284e560580161916a", "ja": "もー、メッチャ驚いたよ！\nまさか兄ちゃんにサプライズされるなんて！", "zh": "真是吓了我一大跳！\n没想到居然会被哥哥来个惊喜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "f3ce85c3085976b29fba4a7f8abc65cdf9884ccd4a890de483aa686f8e4b3b2e", "ja": "開けたら、びっくり箱だったし！　しかもさ～……。\n……兄ちゃんてば、ドッキリの才能アリだよ～！", "zh": "打开一看，居然是惊吓箱！而且啊～……\n兄长你还真有恶作剧的天赋呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a6d470d98f92a03272855de64e0f73eb34f4690db72754a10d732be58ad573b2", "ja": "はは、喜んでくれて何よりだ。\nサプライズが上手くいくか、少し不安だったからな。", "zh": "哈哈，你能喜欢就好。\n我还有点担心惊喜能不能成功呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "dffa4738decaf97af31b41f035f207a5e42c4627c2e48d3177c2c3746d3c0a5f", "ja": "え、そうなの？　でも、タイミングも\nバッチリンコって感じだったよ？", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？不过，时机不是正正好嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "0a0cf966830598e11073e2f173310c4820cb23ead7ef781aa8262eedacf830b1", "ja": "だって真美、プレゼントもらった時、\n変な声出ちゃったし！　湯加減サイテキってやつだね！", "zh": "因为真美收到礼物的时候，都忍不住发出了奇怪的声音嘛！这就叫水温超合适吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1006_p", "source_sha256": "44d245f6424aa1b9fb5d3e0489345da59d045d590546ea5f448da1a8a1f69a14", "ja": "適温で何より……じゃなくて、油断大敵、だな。\nともかく、楽しんでくれたみたいで良かったよ。", "zh": "适温就好……不对，是千万不能大意啊。总之，你好像玩得很开心，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "719bbe6fe3c667d7896cb424ce47cfeda7b2e008327c31dfd5ecd8ab5d672636", "ja": "うん！　超楽しかった～！\n真美、面白いイタズラならいつでも大歓迎だよ！", "zh": "嗯！超级开心～！\n真美随时都欢迎有趣的恶作剧哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1008_p", "source_sha256": "72d59b94748dbe0f09e337500dbcaf5dadde5f77f6418ce5c6f0bfe2ea84ce3c", "ja": "そうなのか？　真美は普段はイタズラする側だけど、\n面白いイタズラなら、されても大丈夫ってことか。", "zh": "是这样吗？真美平时都是恶作剧的一方，不过，如果是有趣的恶作剧，就算被恶作剧也没关系，是这个意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "cf311a21c13ff5d9294e3702bc294ccfa77f1d4ff52713a06400175c018ed47b", "ja": "そうそう！　兄ちゃんのサプライズみたいに、\nびっくりと面白いが合体してればね♪", "zh": "没错没错！只要像哥哥那样的惊喜，把惊讶和有趣结合在一起就没问题啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "2a2111725dce494be4e920ef408989f4b2e1d67f27d2260f183d633d7ffac7a1", "ja": "いやぁ～、なんか逆に勉強させてもらいましたな～。\nやられたーって感じだよ……。やられ……。", "zh": "哎呀～感觉反而是我们学到了一课呢～。\n完全被摆了一道的感觉……被摆……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "8f96f411340f81f29336d6c5dde908d3973fc93918ebd1f3e097c619689e9561", "ja": "ん～～～、なんかちょっと悔しくなってきたかも……。\nぽっと出の兄ちゃんに、イタズラで負かされるなんて！", "zh": "嗯～～～，感觉我有点不甘心了……  \n居然被一个突然冒出来的小哥用恶作剧打败了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1012_p", "source_sha256": "05a9e4b159a0ad90e136ed2790e288dab0c5b1c808bfda4dcdef8f41ed8ade80", "ja": "ぽっと出……。まあ、イタズラは専門外だけど、\n仕事柄、アイディアを練る機会は多いから。", "zh": "刚冒出来的家伙……嘛，恶作剧虽然不是我的专长，不过因为工作的关系，我经常有机会琢磨点子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "a6db995c6320dc63448d3add45bef27166930fb57a5ea7d893a25a13fe126e94", "ja": "くっ……こ、ここでプロデューサーの力を\n発揮してくるとは……！　これが、敗北の味……！？", "zh": "呜……竟、竟然在这种时候发挥出制作人的力量……！这就是失败的滋味……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "20493c8ab3d47b164e11a1d034aae3ad66979e2f5e42678ac1126f4114f7b52a", "ja": "いや、負けてない！　ここで終わる真美ではなーい！\nメチャスゴなイタズラで、仕返ししてやるかんね！", "zh": "不，才没有输！真美可不会就这样结束——！\n我要用超级厉害的恶作剧来报仇啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "ebfcd42e14fabb7ac6bb30ab1f3c93c2d96a11cbf22f755623f1dde342e82248", "ja": "兄ちゃんの上を行く、史上最大のサプライズを\nお見舞いしちゃうんだから！　覚悟しててよね！？", "zh": "我要来一场超越哥哥、史上最大的惊喜！你可要做好心理准备哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3afa6ab0939c977becf1f9a68e509dfdaa8fc41e25974f045b97695bd740f7c3", "ja": "あ、ああ……。お手柔らかに頼むよ。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……下手点，拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "ad743d6d9e67f084febd4e76630a972ce7a476909c3be073a3c263fe0ee3f792", "ja": "うむ、心して待たれよ！　あっ、そだ。兄ちゃん！\n……今日はありがと！　真美、一生忘れないよ！", "zh": "嗯，洗耳恭听吧！　啊，对了。哥！\n……今天谢谢你！　真美一辈子都不会忘记的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0304_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "dc97a43d30664f0097d28f005b40dd3dfaeddbba10ae61d9e018047c3a4fdfdd", "ja": "なんたって、今日は兄ちゃんと真美の、ウルトラ\nスペシャルサプライズプレゼント記念日だかんね♪", "zh": "毕竟今天可是哥哥和真美的超级特别惊喜礼物纪念日嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
